Sitemap Revisions Based on AI Pressure-Test:
Based on my tutor's critique, I am making two immediate changes to my sitemap to fix structural misalignments:

Collapsing the CTA: I am removing the dual-action friction on the final page. I will make "Email me for freelance work" the single primary action, moving LinkedIn to a secondary footer link to keep the funnel focused on high-commitment intent.

Aligning the Claim to the Proof: Since my current portfolio pieces only showcase backend/agent work (Antigravity and Slack scripts), I am temporarily removing "full-stack applications" from my landing page claim. I will add it back only after I have shipped a frontend project to prove it, ensuring I maintain technical credibility with reviewers.
